<!--
    English ribbon captions.

    One entry per caption the ribbon shows. Every key here must exist in every other
    Strings.*.xaml: a key present in one language and missing in another renders as
    nothing at all, which is a blank button rather than an untranslated one. There is a
    test that compares the key sets.
-->
